   "id": "c-decay-law",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "The book prints $\\kcone(\\kt) = \\kcone(0)e^{-\\kgamma \\kt/2 + i\\kDeltaStark \\kt}$, with the sign it gives the shift in Eq. (2.50). The identity (2.49) gives $\\dot{\\kcone} = -\\kcone(\\kgamma/2 + i\\kDeltaStark)$, so $\\kcone(\\kt) = \\kcone(0)e^{-\\kgamma \\kt/2 - i\\kDeltaStark \\kt}$, the sign of the light shift of Eq. (2.22)."
  }
